When launching `locallm`, the terminal displays the real-time telemetry header banner followed by the interactive main menu:

```text
╔════════════════════════════ ✦  ʟ ᴏ ᴄ ᴀ ʟ ʟ ᴍ  ✦ ════════════════════════════╗
